  ShapeAlg.realizes segs scfg (mkCfg ms' (MmapSim.mmap_model a n model)) T ->
  ShapeAlg.realizes segs scfg (mkCfg ms (MmapSim.mmap_model a n model)) T.
Proof.
  intros segs scfg ms ms' model a n T Hh Hlazy Hms Hr.
  chain_mst; [exact Hms | exact Hr].
Qed.

