  srealizes (mkCfg ms model)
            (t_exit (bv_and (ms_gpr ms 0) (Z_to_bv 64 255)) (m_fs model)).
Proof.
  intros ms model x8 Hh Hsvc Hx8.
  apply srealizes_of_realizes. apply (rz_exit segs scfg ms model x8); assumption.
Qed.

